    "chunk_text": "liemed, \u00e6t o\u00ferum gefangen. He w\u00e6s on Romana onwalde, for \u00feon \u00fee hie hiene \u00fe\u00e6r gesetton. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Mantius se consul for on Numentine, Ispania folc, & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s winnende o\u00fe he genom \u00dea he ham com, \u00fea heton hiene Romane gebindan, & gebringean beforan Numentia f\u00e6stennes \u00dea naw\u00feer ne hine \u00fea eft ham l\u00e6dan ne dorston \u00fee hiene \u00feider l\u00e6ddon, ne his \u00fea onfon noldon \u00fee On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum Brutus se consul ofslog Ispania folces LX M, \u00fea w\u00e6ron Lusitaniam on fultume. & ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s he for eft on Lusitanie, & hiera ofslog L M, & VI M gefeng. On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum for Lapidus se consul on \u00fea nearran Ispanie, & gefliemed wear\u00f0, & his folces & \u00fea \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r aweg comon, hie o\u00feflugon mid \u00fe\u00e6m m\u00e6stan bismre. Hw\u00e6\u00feer Romane hit witen nu \u00e6negum men to secganne, hw\u00e6t hiera folces on Ispanium on \u00deonne hie from ges\u00e6lgum tidum gilpa\u00f0, \u00feonne w\u00e6ron \u00fea him selfum \u00fea unges\u00e6lgestan. \u00d0a \u00fea Seruius Fuluius & Flaccus Quintus w\u00e6ron consulas, wear\u00fe on Rome an cild geboren, \u00fe\u00e6t On \u00fe\u00e6m geare asprong up \u00c6\u00fena fyr on Sicilium, & mare \u00fe\u00e6s landes forb\u00e6rnde \u00feonne hit \u00e6fre \u00e6r \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s DC wintrum & XX, \u00fea \u00fea Mantius gedyde \u00feone yfelan Hie sindon on \u00fe\u00e6m nor\u00f0westende Ispania; & heo hie",
